# Feature description: Log-transformed Debt-to-Income Ratio to make excessively large or small values more manageable and detect nonlinear relationships.
# Usefulness: Reduces the impact of outliers in Debt_to_Income while preserving the fundamental ratio. This transformation helps the model learn more effectively from this financial metric.
